OL,3,GNEWSAWorker at care home in BBC
OL,4,Ainvestigation faces being struck off
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home worker who was secretly
OL,7,Ffilmed causing distress to an
OL,8,F81-year-old resident with dementia
OL,9,Ffaces being struck off.
OL,11,FA Scottish Social Services Council
OL,12,F(SSSC) panel has found eight
OL,13,Fallegations against Amina Sani proven,
OL,14,Fincluding that she threatened to call
OL,15,Fthe police after the man became
OL,16,Fdistressed at the prospect of being
OL,17,Fshowered against his will.
OL,19,FSani denied the allegations, claiming
OL,20,Fshe had not been trained properly and
OL,21,Fwas inexperienced due to it being her
OL,22,Ffirst job in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
